Bundled third-party runtimes under `assets/` keep their own licenses:

- `assets/pdfjs/` — PDF.js 3.11.174, Apache License 2.0
  (https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js)
- `assets/katex/` — KaTeX, MIT License
  (https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX)

KaTeX's stylesheet and web fonts are NOT bundled: DocMate reuses the copies the
DeepSeek Harness frontend already serves.
